    "Basic is quick; Advanced refines the mask against the layer's own detail, for hair and fur": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“基本”更快；“高级”会按图层细节修蒙版，适合头发和皮毛。"
